1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,326
Falconwood: a quiet town with a government lab, mysterious deaths, and people who

2
00:00:04,326 --> 00:00:05,271
want the truth out.

3
00:00:05,491 --> 00:00:07,240
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:12,265
Set aside the Survive the Hunt Terror card, both Mission Item cards and the Friend

5
00:00:12,265 --> 00:00:14,723
cards. They only come in when a Mission says so.

6
00:00:14,943 --> 00:00:18,965
Before normal setup, pick one of the five Missions at random and follow the setup on

7
00:00:18,965 --> 00:00:19,444
its sheet.

8
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,410
Completing the Mission is mandatory to win.

9
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:25,151
Until it's done, the Killer can't lose its last health:

10
00:00:25,151 --> 00:00:28,291
any damage that would reveal its Final Health token is ignored.

11
00:00:28,291 --> 00:00:31,083
With more than one Killer, this applies to the last one.

12
00:00:31,303 --> 00:00:33,620
Some cards say Gain Progress or Lose Progress.

13
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:37,851
Check your Mission sheet for what that means, and put a tracking marker on the sheet

14
00:00:37,851 --> 00:00:38,556
as a reminder.

15
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:41,695
Completing a Mission brings a Friend to help you.

16
00:00:41,695 --> 00:00:44,167
Friends are Special Victims, with three differences.

17
00:00:44,387 --> 00:00:46,385
They will follow you into the Killer's space.

18
00:00:46,385 --> 00:00:48,782
Other Victims in their space are attacked before them.

19
00:00:48,782 --> 00:00:50,957
And they don't panic while they're in your space.

20
00:00:51,177 --> 00:00:55,877
Each Friend card gives a bonus. The Adopted Father, for example, turns one die into

21
00:00:55,877 --> 00:00:58,879
a success on damaging Action cards and adds a damage.

22
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:03,134
In Missing Friend, six tokens sit on the named non-Search spaces.

23
00:01:03,134 --> 00:01:05,775
End a move on one and spend one Time to reveal it.

24
00:01:05,775 --> 00:01:10,107
Each shows a letter and number; the reference card turns it into a clue, like east

25
00:01:10,107 --> 00:01:10,793
of the river.

26
00:01:11,013 --> 00:01:15,340
Keep one token of each letter. When you have A, B and C, the clues point to one

27
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:18,352
space. The Best Friend lies there, ignored by everyone.

28
00:01:18,572 --> 00:01:22,408
Go there and discard any healing Action card, like Short Rest, to revive her.

29
00:01:22,408 --> 00:01:24,600
Take the Spell Book and drop Horror to zero.

30
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,593
While she's with you, Horror can't rise.

31
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,587
In Save Your Father, pairs of tokens sit at the Government Lab, Shopping Mall and

32
00:01:31,587 --> 00:01:35,722
Best Friend's House. End a move there and discard a Search card to add both to a

33
00:01:35,722 --> 00:01:37,789
face-down pool, along with three blanks.

34
00:01:38,009 --> 00:01:42,133
Once per Action phase at the Police Station, spend one Time at a time to reveal

35
00:01:42,133 --> 00:01:44,482
tokens from the pool. Stop whenever you like.

36
00:01:44,482 --> 00:01:47,823
If you reveal a second blank, or run out of Time, you must stop.

37
00:01:48,043 --> 00:01:51,551
Two blanks ends your Action phase and everything goes back in the pool.

38
00:01:51,551 --> 00:01:55,207
Stop before that, and the blanks are removed and the keys go on the sheet.

39
00:01:55,207 --> 00:01:56,640
Three keys frees your Father.

40
00:01:57,467 --> 00:02:01,718
In Crack the Code, end your move on a token space and spend one Time to reveal it

41
00:02:01,718 --> 00:02:04,763
and put it on the sheet. Each has a value from one to six.

42
00:02:04,983 --> 00:02:09,210
At the Shopping Mall, spend three Time and roll the d20, adding the values of your

43
00:02:09,210 --> 00:02:12,407
tokens. Twenty or more cracks it. Less, and you can try again.

44
00:02:12,627 --> 00:02:16,464
The Jockette joins you at the Mall, and you take one Item of your choice from its

45
00:02:16,464 --> 00:02:16,701
deck.

46
00:02:17,533 --> 00:02:20,672
In Expose the Lab, three tokens sit on the Government Lab.

47
00:02:20,672 --> 00:02:25,055
Enter it to reveal the first; its number shows a space on the board, so place the

48
00:02:25,055 --> 00:02:25,704
token there.

49
00:02:25,924 --> 00:02:29,849
End your move on that space and discard a Search card to collect it, revealing the

50
00:02:29,849 --> 00:02:33,583
next. When you have three, end your move at the Police Station to complete it.

51
00:02:33,803 --> 00:02:37,508
The Reporter joins you, and you take two Items of your choice from the Police

52
00:02:37,508 --> 00:02:38,133
Station deck.

53
00:02:38,967 --> 00:02:42,955
In Survive the Hunt, the mission starts when its Terror card appears, somewhere in

54
00:02:42,955 --> 00:02:46,992
the top eight cards. Four Agents appear at the Town Fair, Shopping Mall, Government

55
00:02:46,992 --> 00:02:48,353
Lab and Best Friend's House.

56
00:02:48,573 --> 00:02:51,260
Agents have one health, movement two and attack two.

57
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:55,032
At the end of each Killer phase, each one targets you, moves and attacks.

58
00:02:55,032 --> 00:02:56,531
Victims in their space panic.

59
00:02:56,751 --> 00:03:01,194
Kill all four to complete it. The Kind Scientist joins you, you take Telekinesis,

60
00:03:01,194 --> 00:03:03,663
recover three health and lower Horror by two.

61
00:03:04,467 --> 00:03:08,248
Bridges are the roads over the river, plus the Bridge token if it's placed.

62
00:03:08,248 --> 00:03:10,013
River Crossings are the blue lines.

63
00:03:10,233 --> 00:03:14,635
You normally can't use River Crossings. Some cards let you, and Victims can follow,

64
00:03:14,635 --> 00:03:15,801
but Enemies never can.

65
00:03:16,021 --> 00:03:20,512
Spaces joined only by a River Crossing are not adjacent, for range or for anything

66
00:03:20,512 --> 00:03:21,717
that checks adjacency.

67
00:03:21,937 --> 00:03:24,753
Many cards use the twenty-sided die, the d20.

68
00:03:25,567 --> 00:03:28,382
A few tips. Plan your route around the Mission from turn one:

69
00:03:28,382 --> 00:03:30,089
the Killer can't die until it's done.

70
00:03:30,309 --> 00:03:34,560
Keep your Friend alive once they join. The Pizza Delivery van and Dragon's Breath

71
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,557
are standout finds.

72
00:03:35,777 --> 00:03:38,228
Players find it one of the easier locations.

73
00:03:38,228 --> 00:03:38,785
Good luck.

